{"id":"snow-stone","name":{"en":"Snow Stone","ja":"樹氷石"},"desc":{"en":"A cold stone. Because it's covered in frost all the time, no one knows what it really looks like. Some put it in a box to make a cheap refrigerator.","ja":"とても冷たい石。常に周りが霜に覆われてい るので、本当はどんな形をしてるのかよく分 からない。箱などに入れて家に一個置いてお くと、冷蔵庫代わりになって重宝する。"},"level":3,"locations":[{"id":"alanya-area","name":{"en":"Alanya Area","ja":"アランヤ周辺地域"}},{"id":"continental-coastline","name":{"en":"Continental Coastline","ja":"大陸海岸線"}},{"id":"silver-lands","name":{"en":"Silver Lands","ja":"白銀の大地"}}],"traits":{"id":"ice-power","name":{"en":"Ice Power","ja":"冷気の力"}},"categories":[{"id":"ore","name":{"en":"(Ore)","ja":"（鉱石類）"},"icon":"totori-category-ore"},{"id":"supplement","name":{"en":"(Supplement)","ja":"（中和剤）"},"icon":"totori-category-supplement"}],"item_type":"Ingredient","index":25}